{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49691","headline":"定风波 · 阎选","name":"定风波","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江水沈沈帆影过，游鱼到晚透寒波。\n渡口双双飞白鸟，烟嫋，芦花深处隐渔歌。\n扁舟短櫂归兰浦，人去，萧萧竹径透青莎。\n深夜无风新雨歇，凉月，露迎珠颗入圆荷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎选","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49691.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49691","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}